{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>美國總統特朗普11月26日在佛羅裏達州海湖莊園接受記者採訪時，再次談及英偉達CEO黃仁勳復職事件。</strong>特朗普表示，自己推動黃仁勳重新執掌英偉達，是為美國乃至全世界做了一件大好事，並稱黃仁勳目前對回歸感到非常高興。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1588188.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T09:43:57.683114+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":110,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T09:26:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T09:37:13.864204+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T09:37:13.864204+00:00","content_hash":"fb199e6cc91bcac4caf989f9e5050c2943a0c9682f2c0b3c81151f2c11a40331","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}